# Database Rules

All schema changes require Alembic migration.

Rules:

- Do not manually modify production database schema.
- Do not delete applied migrations.
- Money fields must include currency suffix.
- Time fields must clarify meaning and timezone.
- Large queries must paginate.
- Common filters should consider indexes.
